{"id":7198,"date":"2022-08-06T12:43:45","date_gmt":"2022-08-06T12:43:45","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/?post_type=student&#038;p=7198"},"modified":"2022-08-06T14:34:35","modified_gmt":"2022-08-06T14:34:35","slug":"mildred-aduamoah","status":"publish","type":"student","link":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/student\/mildred-aduamoah\/","title":{"rendered":"Mildred Aduamoah"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover has-background-dim profile-banner bg-alt\" style=\"background-color:none\"><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\">\n\n\n<a href=\"javascript:history.back()\"> <div class=\"profiles-btn\"> \n\n<div class=\"btn-left-sq bg-primary\"> <i class=\"fa fa-caret-left white-text\"> <\/i> <\/div>\n<div class=\"btn-text title-bold white-text\">Back to Profiles<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/a>\n\n<h2 class=\"profile-name\">Mildred Aduamoah<\/h2>\n\n<p class=\"primary-bold profile-position prof-pos\"><span class=\"primary-text is-bold\"><\/span>Ghana<\/p>\n\n<p class=\"profile-info profile-tagline primary-bold prof-pos\"><span class=\"primary-text is-bold\"><\/span>PhD Student &#8211; University of Edinburgh<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-group pad-5 profile-body\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/08\/Mildred.png\"\/>\n\n<p class=\"profile-testimonial invis\"><span class=\"primary-text is-bold\"><\/span> <\/p>\n\n<p class=\"profile-success invis\"><span class=\"primary-text is-bold\"><\/span> <\/p>\n\n<p class=\"profile-studentbio invis\"><span class=\"primary-text is-bold\"><\/span> <\/p>\n\n\n<p>Mildred Aduamoah is a final year PhD student at the University of Edinburgh. With research in&nbsp; Analysis and its Applications, she focuses on optimisation problems from industry, including robotics, beer brewery and opinion dynamics. This versatile numerical framework can be used to solve optimisation problems from biology and physics. She got admitted into her PhD program through interactions with lecturers in AIMS-Ghana, and the skills gained doing a PhD made her a desirable candidate to work in the tech industry. Outside her PhD studies, Mildred works as a software engineer in The Hut Group. As a software engineer, she develops applications that automate the onboarding of&nbsp;clients onto the company\u2019s plethora&nbsp;of e-commerce services. E-commerce has&nbsp;become an alternative to physical retail and significantly made buying and selling easier during the lockdown periods of the covid 19 pandemic.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Mildred Aduamoah is a final year PhD student at the University of Edinburgh. With research in&nbsp; Analysis and its Applications, she focuses on optimisation problems from industry, including robotics, beer brewery and opinion dynamics. This versatile numerical framework can be used to solve optimisation problems from biology and physics. She got admitted into her PhD<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":12,"featured_media":7199,"parent":0,"template":"","meta":{"advgb_blocks_editor_width":"","advgb_blocks_columns_visual_guide":"","profile-testimonial":"","profile-success":"","profile-studentbio":"","profile-studentname":"Mildred Aduamoah","profile-country":"Ghana","profile-program":"PhD Student - University of Edinburgh"},"tags":[],"student_types":[13],"acf":[],"featured_img":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2022\/08\/Mildred.png","coauthors":[],"author_meta":{"author_link":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/author\/joel\/","display_name":"joel"},"relative_dates":{"created":"Posted 3 years ago","modified":"Updated 3 years ago"},"absolute_dates":{"created":"Posted on August 6, 2022","modified":"Updated on August 6, 2022"},"absolute_dates_time":{"created":"Posted on August 6, 2022 12:43 pm","modified":"Updated on August 6, 2022 2:34 pm"},"featured_img_caption":"","tax_additional":{"post_tag":{"linked"